### Create a ticket
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mon premier ticket",
  "description": "Créé depuis Zed"
}

### List all tickets
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets

### Get ticket by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/1

### Create ticket without description
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ticket sans description"
}

### Validation error: empty title
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Doit échouer avec 400"
}

### Not found: ticket inexistant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/9999
